  <developer_name>Nicolas Haas</developer_name>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">ch.haas_nicolas.gospeak.desktop</launchable>
  <description>
    <p>
      GoSpeak is a privacy-focused voice communication client built in Go.
      It connects to self-hosted GoSpeak servers for encrypted voice chat,
      text chat, and channel-based collaboration.
    </p>
    <p>
      The desktop client provides a native Fyne UI, configurable voice activity
      detection, bookmarks, and per-user settings suitable for sandboxed
      package-manager distribution.
    </p>
  </description>
